| Light | Examples | Action |
|-------|----------|--------|
| 🟢 Green | Internal file reading, committee attendance, formal reporting | Normal |
| 🟡 Amber | Public mentions of AnYi, business with AnYi subsidiaries, personal product promotion within AnYi | Avoid consciously |
| 🔴 Red | Company formation, commercial acts in AnYi cadre identity, receiving benefits from AnYi subsidiaries | NEVER |

